<title>USA: NetMed Inc Q4 Dec 31 shr loss $0.01.</title>
<headline>NetMed Inc Q4 Dec 31 shr loss $0.01.</headline>
<dateline>DUBLIN, Ohio 1997-02-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Three Months Ending  Twelve Months Ending</p>
<p>				   December 31,	December 31,</p>
<p>				 1996	1995	1996	 1995</p>
<p> Royalty Revenue     $115,975    $22,225  $222,002    $84,000</p>
<p>Operating income (loss)</p>
<p>			 (729,437)  (415,582) (1,737,693) (641,788)</p>
<p>Net Income (Loss)  (159,563)  2,716,162 (825,314)  2,506,546 Earnings (loss) per Share</p>
<p>				(.01)	  .25     (.06)	  .23</p>
<p>Note: The company on a proforma basis incurred one-time merger expenses of $622,629 in 1996 compared to $192,869 for 1995.</p>
<p>For the quarter ending December 31, 1996 one time merger expenses, on a proforma basis, were $223,865 compared to $192,869 for the quarter ending December 31, 1995.</p>
